## 14. Final scope lock

The Razor MVP is complete when a judge can experience this sequence:

```text
Declare intention
        ↓
Start timed session
        ↓
YouTube Search Mode activates
        ↓
Search intentionally for the goal
        ↓
Open relevant content → continue quietly
        ↓
Open unrelated content → receive a gentle warning
        ↓
Choose what to do
        ↓
End session or timer expires
        ↓
Search Mode and monitoring stop
        ↓
Normal browsing returns
```

Anything outside that sequence is optional and should be rejected during the four-hour build.
